    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;</p><p>The above reaction is carried out in a vessel starting with partial pressure <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>250</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>bar</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>750</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>bar</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>bar</mi></math>.&nbsp;When the reaction is complete, the total pressure in the reaction vessel is _____&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>bar</mi></math>.&nbsp;</p><p>(Round off of the nearest integer).</p>"
